| 13 | `Part13_OddBlockUV` | `OddBlockUV` | the ultraviolet constant chain at block ratio 3: the Brezzi a priori bound and perturbation tools; Lemma W at ratio 3; Lemmas I and J and the constants of the curvature transfer CT′; Theorem U and the tree-gauge loss at ratio 3; the side-3 block-gap counts; examples and witnesses |
