/-- The base-3 digit `ν` of a site `x < 81` of the block `{0,1,2}⁴`.

Scope: a statement about one proof method at Gaussian order; lattice inputs enter only as
hypotheses; nothing about the Yang–Mills measure; (D), (E) and the mass gap remain open. -/
def dig (x ν : ℕ) : ℕ := x / 3 ^ ν % 3

/-- A link `(x, μ)` of the block `{0,1,2}⁴` is internal if its offset satisfies `o_μ ≤ 1`.

Scope: a statement about one proof method at Gaussian order; lattice inputs enter only as
hypotheses; nothing about the Yang–Mills measure; (D), (E) and the mass gap remain open. -/
def isInternal (x μ : ℕ) : Bool := decide (dig x μ ≤ 1)

